@startuml activity-digitalizer
!include elvira.iuml
' What: the digitalizer runs every book through the same pipeline and asks a person only about the pages it was unsure of.
' Source: evilflowers-books-digitalizer README and docs/studio.md (2026-11-16)
' Scope: the Restoration Studio flow for one book. Left out: the classic batch CLI, Internet Archive upload, training-data export.

title Books digitalizer: one scanned book (2026-11)

start
:TIFF scans of two-page spreads;
:Split spreads, clean pages\n(ScanTailor);
:OCR (Tesseract)\nlayout regions, formulas;
:Quality gate\nOCR confidence, disputed regions,\nformula fallbacks, missing pages;
if (score high enough?) then (yes)
  :Approved automatically;
else (no)
  :Review queue;
  :Operator fixes regions on a page\nand re-runs that page;
  :Operator approves the book;
endif
:Render distribution PDF,\nPDF/A-2b master, EPUB;
:Publish to the catalog\n(REST API with an API key);
stop

caption A republish updates the same catalog entry. The output folder is also a valid Internet Archive item.
@enduml
